  "sourceTitle": "Qpc Cornbread",
  "sourceText": "Qpc Cornbread\nBy: Quay Po Cooks\nPublished: Monday, January 10, 2011 - 2:16am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n(A)\n1 cup corn meal\n1 cup plain flour\n1/4 cup sugar\n1 tablespoon baking powder\n1 teaspoon salt\n(B)\n cup vegetable oil\n1 egg\n1 cup milk\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Preheat oven to 200C or 400F. Grease 8 inches square pan. Combine (A).  Add (B). Pour blend into prepared pan.  Bake for 20 – 25 mins.\n\nAbout\n\n\nCornbread that goes well with any cream soup and makes a tasty healthy meal.",
